+'\" t
+.\"     Title: yasm_parsers
+.\"    Author: Peter Johnson <peter@tortall.net>
+.\" Generator: DocBook XSL Stylesheets v1.75.2 <http://docbook.sf.net/>
+.\"      Date: October 2006
+.\"    Manual: Yasm Supported Parsers
